        "content": "## Agent Sessions Audit Trail\n\nThis dashboard provides a session-level view of agent activity.\n\n**Workflow:**\n1. Use the **Agent Name** filter above to narrow down agents\n2. Find a session in the table below and click the **Session ID** link to drill in\n3. The **Session Detail** section shows a trace timeline plus tables of all LLM calls and MCP tool calls for that session\n4. Click a **Trace ID** in the detail tables to jump to the full request waterfall in the GenAI or MCP dashboard\n\n**Tip:** You can also paste a session ID directly into the **Session ID** variable above.",
